Package: ADaMViz.SubmissionSync
Title: From Clinical Questions to Review-Ready Figures and
Reproducible R Code
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ramnath", "Dhadage", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ram.dhadage123@gmail.com")
Description: Generates and conversationally refines ggplot2 visualizations from Analysis Data Model (ADaM) datasets and other permitted tabular data. Executes generated R code in a controlled environment and records input metadata, code, package versions, outputs, and review status to support reproducibility, traceability, and validation of clinical reporting workflows.
